{"sections":[{"slug":"经典力学系统","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"经典力学系统"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">经典力学系统</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"经典力学系统"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">使用</span> Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">经典力学系统的一种定义是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换</span> Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">相空间</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的形式对偶</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在这种定义下</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/辛流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">辛流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">以及更一般的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson流形","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">都给出经典力学系统</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">量子化</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于经典力学系统中的</span> Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们可以问它的</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">结构对应的</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群是什么</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这是因为我们将这个</span> Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">代数的元素想象为某个整体对象的无穷小版本</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称之为量子变换群</span> (quantomorphism group). <span lang=\"zh\">这个群与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/量子化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">量子化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">直接相关</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/量子力学系统","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">量子力学系统</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}